=== intro ===

You wake to heat on your cheek and a sharp tug in your chest. Your muscles ache. Your mouth tastes like copper and salt. The sand is gone—there’s moss beneath your back now, damp and cool.

+ [You groan and roll onto your side.]
    -> fire_scene

=== fire_scene ===

A fire crackles ahead of you. Big. Too big for one person. Orange light flickers against roots and low fog. Someone’s speaking—casual, rhythmic, already mid-thought.

"Bitalgut" "You ever see the lobe twitch like that before, Bolk? Hells, I haven’t. Not that close. Not with the core-light running all twitchy."

A small figure squats beside the fire, knees spread, tail curled against his side. His skin glistens faintly—smooth, amphibian-dark, flecked with old scars or moss-stains. One hand grips a long walking stick jabbed into the dirt. The other stirs a steaming tin cup set atop a flat rock.

He doesn’t look at you. Just stares into the flames like they’re talking back.

"Bitalgut" "Teqqellon’s a quiet one. Doesn’t strike first unless it thinks you’ll wriggle nice. You?"

-> show_portrait

=== show_portrait ===

<< SHOW_PORTRAIT >>

"Bitalgut" "You wriggled."

His eyes flick your way. Wide. Too wide. Reflecting the fire like polished stone. -> DONE
